  "private": false,
  "description": "A node.js modern recipe search app built with vanilla JavaScript (ES6) that lets users search and manage 1,000,000+ recipes via the Food2Fork API. It demonstrates MVC architecture with Webpack and responsive design. Features include search recipe views adjustable servings shopping list and favorites",
